     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_acherim_gadlehu_meachav",
     "gloss_en": "Others: from where that if he has none, his brethren the priests make him great? 'the priest who is greater than his brethren' -- make him great from what is his brethren's"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Chullin.134b.4",
